{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Lures</strong> is an <strong>idle</strong> <strong>fishing sim</strong>\u00a0that sits at the bottom of your screen. Play Little Lures at your own pace, it's a casual game you can play while you multitask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900250/extras/8c82ae49ed86cfc5b7f7e40417daaee6.avif?t=1755699549\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Spots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place and manage fishing spots for your towns people to catch various types of fresh water and salt water fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Bait</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bait farms to collect bait for your towns people to fish.<strong>\u00a0The Barn</strong>\u00a0allows you to manage<strong> pigs</strong>\u00a0that will automate your bait farms.<strong> The Chicken Coop</strong>\u00a0allows you to manage<strong> chickens</strong>\u00a0that will dig up bait around the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900250/extras/220c28f41ff8aee30d6f6fa51aac7e1d.avif?t=1755699549\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900250?t=1755699549","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900250?t=1755699549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900250/20147cdd16dc7833651ad532a65fcd8d3640c6f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755699549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c